<p>0.30</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Fail</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"AIP-186:EnhancedFacialRecognitionwithVisionModels-RecognitionAdap=
tation"><strong>Recognition Adaptation</strong></h4>
<p>Graph showing adaptive thresholds based on face quality:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>X-axis: Face Quality</p></li>
<li>
<p>Y-axis: Identification Threshold</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
